         "t": "text",
         "html": "<p>Some practices try an AI generator to get a quick logo for a new location. The image may look polished, but it is usually a low-resolution PNG with soft edges, invented letters in the practice name, or medical symbols drawn incorrectly. We rebuild AI-made healthcare logos by hand as clean vectors with properly set type, so they are ready for signs and print.</p><p>Learn how our <a href=\"/fix-ai-generated-logo/\">AI logo cleanup and vector conversion</a> works, or send us your file for a free review.</p>",
