    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": "h2",
     "text": "Where Can I Get a Medical Practice Logo Designed in Austin?",
     "align": "left",
     "classes": []
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p>Logo Design Austin designs logos for healthcare practices across Austin and Central Texas, entirely online. Practice owners and office managers can talk with a designer by phone or text and review concepts between appointments, with no in-person meetings required.</p><h3>Clinic and specialist logos near the medical district Downtown (78701) and in Hyde Park (78751)</h3><p>Practices near the downtown hospitals and UT often share buildings with many other providers. A distinctive, readable logo helps patients find the right suite and remember your name for follow-up visits.</p><h3>Family medicine, pediatric and dental logos in Mueller (78723), Circle C (78739) and Cedar Park (78613)</h3><p>Neighborhood practices serving families benefit from a warm, approachable identity that still looks professional on insurance directories and school forms.</p><h3>Therapy, wellness and med spa logos in Westlake (78746) and Bee Cave (78738)</h3><p>Aesthetic and wellness clinics usually want a refined, calm look. We lean on elegant type, soft palettes and simple marks that translate well to product labels and social media.</p><h3>How much does a medical logo cost in Austin?</h3><p>A custom medical logo at Logo Design Austin is priced from $125 to $175, depending on complexity. There is no upfront payment; you review concepts, request revisions and pay once you approve. For larger systems, our guide to <a href=\"/hospital-branding-austin/\">hospital branding</a> covers what a full healthcare brand involves.</p>",
     "align": "left",
     "classes": []
    },
    {
     "t": "container",
     "classes": [],
